      docHeroQuoteImg: "<strong>iMagina</strong> is the core enterprise operations and financial portal developed for <strong>Rhapsody Media S.L.U.</strong> (Walstead Group / Rotocobrhi) hosted on a Synology NAS (<code>RMNAS10</code>), orchestrating the full graphic lifecycle from budget to automated ERP invoicing across <code>Server A</code> and <code>Server B</code>.",
